abstract: 'Linear algebra helpers: vectorization and half-vectorization, symmetric
  matrices from their half-vectorization, the duplication matrix and its Moore-Penrose
  inverse, deviation scores, and tests for symmetric and positive definite matrices.
  Each exported function has an internal version without input checks that other projects
  can copy.'
